  "notes": "Used for anything that looks somewhat red: hair, soil, light, skin.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {赤|あか}っぽい⟦{色|いろ}→色：00849_iro⟧: a reddish color\n- ⟦{顔|かお}→顔：00558_kao⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{赤|あか}っぽい: one's face looks a bit red (from heat, a fever, drink)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{赤|あか}い→赤い：00585_akai⟧: red — the plain color word\n- ⟦{赤|あか}み→赤み：31758_akami⟧がかった: tinged with red — more descriptive, written style\n- ⟦{白|しろ}っぽい→白っぽい：33949_shiroppoi⟧: whitish — the same pattern",
